<title>USA: Taiwan's MFIG seeks up to 60,000T U.S. corn -trade.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's MFIG seeks up to 60,000T U.S. corn -trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Members Feed Industry Group was scheduled to tender late Tuesday for 56,000 to 60,000 tonnes of U.S. No. 2 corn, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>It seeks the corn for September 7-21 shipment if from the Gulf of Mexico or September 22-October 6 if from the Pacific Northwest.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
